Package: plotgardenerNeo
Type: Package
Title: Neo-Chromosome Plotting Extensions for plotgardener
Version: 1.15.1.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("plotgardenerNeo", "contributors", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "noreply@example.org")
    )
Description: Extends plotgardener 1.15.1 with neo-chromosome assembly
    parsing, neo Hi-C reconstruction and plotting, IGV-style neo gene
    tracks, and helpers for mapping genome-wide signal tracks into neo
    coordinates. This package builds on the plotgardener 1.15.1 API and
    depends on a patched plotgardener (>= 1.15.1.9000) for the core fixes
    used by the neo functions.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends:
    R (>= 4.2.0),
    plotgardener (>= 1.15.1.9000)
